cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying dataset, please cite the following works."
title: "Orchard Semantic Segmentation with Multi-line LiDAR (基于多线激光雷达的果园语义分割)"
abstract: "Code and annotated point cloud dataset for full-scene semantic segmentation and tree-trunk instance segmentation in standardized orchards, using a VLP-16 multi-line LiDAR. The dataset contains 9 annotated classes over 20 sequences (1779 frames) in KITTI/SemanticKITTI format."
